s of the Coast","work":"The Battle of Fort Keff","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2010-03-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-battle-of-fort-keff","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-battle-of-fort-keff#:~:text=Refugees%20had%20been%20arriving,already%2Dcrowded%20haven%20all%20morning.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Battle of Fort Keff\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Mar 2010."}},{"id":"the-battle-of-fort-keff-e7","era":null,"summary":"Gideon learns from the surrakar that the gods come from a void without color, time and boundaries and will devour all existence.","participants":["gideon-jura","surrakar-prisoner"],"location":"fort-keff","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-battle-of-fort-keff","order":241,"story_date":"2010-03-31","storyline":"The Eldrazi Awaken","source":"wizards","paragraph":39,"quote":"They had been ripped from a void without color, without time, and without boundaries.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-battle-of-fort-keff#:~:text=They%20had%20been%20ripped,time%2C%20and%20without%20boundaries.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Battle of Fort Keff","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Jenna Helland"],"date":"2010-03-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-battle-of-fort-keff","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-battle-of-fort-keff#:~:text=They%20had%20been%20ripped,time%2C%20and%20without%20boundaries.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Battle of Fort Keff\" by Jenna Helland. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Mar 2010."}},{"id":"the-battle-of-fort-keff-e8","era":null,"summary":"Gideon offers to help defend the fort, and the captain agrees.","participants":["gideon-jura","captain-of-the-guard-of-fort-keff"],"location":"fort-keff","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-battle-of-fort-keff","o